@prefix skos:    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ecaa:    <https://w3id.org/ecaa/ns/0.2#> .
@prefix vocab:   <https://w3id.org/ecaa/vocab/> .

#######################################################################
# Registered, EXTENSIBLE SKOS concept schemes for the three closed
# enums. Membership is validated via skos:inScheme (NOT sh:in), so a
# v0.2+ minor that ADDS a concept is additive: existing packages stay
# conformant and the membership SHACL keeps passing. skos:notation is
# the serde wire form (snake_case); it is the canonical token the
# C/Q/F/A wire JSON carries.
#######################################################################

# --- BlockerKind (F sub-graph; 50 concepts) --------------------------
